00:24:24.950 --> 00:24:25.883
SHAKE HANDS AND PUT THEIR

00:24:25.884 --> 00:24:27.351
HANDS IN THE AIR AND THE

00:24:27.352 --> 00:24:28.552
BRIGHT LIGHTS AND ACT LIKE

00:24:28.553 --> 00:24:31.322
THEY PLAYED A ROLE IN IT.

00:24:31.323 --> 00:24:31.956
MAYBE SO.

00:24:31.957 --> 00:24:34.658
BUT WAITING AROUND FOR THEM TO

00:24:34.659 --> 00:24:36.694
GET ON BOARD IS, I DON'T THINK

00:24:36.695 --> 00:24:38.195
WE HAVE THE LUXURY TO DO THAT.

00:24:38.196 --> 00:24:39.497
WE HAVE TO BRING THEM ON

00:24:39.498 --> 00:24:39.864
BOARD.

00:24:39.865 --> 00:24:41.999
LIKE WE HAVE TO BRING THE

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:44.802
SWING VOTERS TO OUR SIDE.

00:24:44.803 --> 00:24:45.636
NOT GO DEFENSIVE.

00:24:45.637 --> 00:24:47.171
AND TRY NOT TO OFFEND ANYBODY

00:24:47.172 --> 00:24:49.273
AND HOPE WE SHOW THEM WE ARE

00:24:49.274 --> 00:24:50.508
NICE PEOPLE.

00:24:50.509 --> 00:24:51.909
IF WE HAVEN'T PROVEN WE ARE

00:24:51.910 --> 00:24:53.210
NICE PEOPLE AFTER ALL OF THESE

00:24:53.211 --> 00:24:54.812
YEARS, IT'S A LOST CAUSE.

00:24:54.813 --> 00:24:57.047
WE HAVE TO ENGAGE IN ISSUES

00:24:57.048 --> 00:24:58.849
THAT MATTER MOST TO THE

00:24:58.850 --> 00:24:59.850
AMERICAN PEOPLE AND WILL

00:24:59.851 --> 00:25:02.953
IMPROVE THEIR LIVES, MAKE THEM

00:25:02.954 --> 00:25:04.555
FEEL TRUST AND HOPEFUL ABOUT

00:25:04.556 --> 00:25:05.689
THEIR COUNTRY AND THEIR

00:25:05.690 --> 00:25:06.223
FUTURE.

00:25:06.224 --> 00:25:07.558
THERE ARE GOBS OF PEOPLE THAT

00:25:07.559 --> 00:25:08.659
WANT TO FEEL THIS WAY.

00:25:08.660 --> 00:25:10.494
GOBS OF PEOPLE OUT THERE THAT

00:25:10.495 --> 00:25:11.595
WANT TO BE PROUD OF THE

00:25:11.596 --> 00:25:12.129
COUNTRY.

00:25:12.130 --> 00:25:13.597
I JUST TAP INTO IT AND MAKE IT

00:25:13.598 --> 00:25:13.998
HAPPEN.

00:25:13.999 --> 00:25:17.034
YEP, YEP, YEP THERE.

00:25:17.035 --> 00:25:18.202
-- YEP.

00:25:18.203 --> 00:25:19.270
THERE I GO AGAIN.

00:25:19.271 --> 00:25:19.737
&gt;&gt; Sean: LISTEN.

00:25:19.738 --> 00:25:23.074
THANK YOU.

